Before attempting to inline the call, check whether the shared function is a class constructor and emit a runtime throw if so:

  if (IsClassConstructor(shared->kind())) {
    return BuildCallRuntime(Runtime::kThrowConstructorNonCallableError, {target_node});
  }

This check must appear immediately inside the `if (shared.has_value())` block, before `BuildCheckJSFunction` and before `TryBuildCallKnownJSFunction`.
